# >>> kiro-sdlc-kit >>>
# Kit-owned: regenerated by `kiro-sdlc-init --force`. Delete this block to commit the kit.
# (openspec/, docs/, memory/ are intentionally NOT ignored — commit those. Two exceptions:
# memory/*/_index.md is a regenerable digest that collides across parallel branches; /context/
# is ignored by explicit project choice — symlink it into new worktrees, see SKILL.md.
# .kiro/* ignores kit machinery CONTENTS while !.kiro/specs/ keeps team-committed specs
# visible — never collapse to `.kiro/`: git would stop descending and the negation dies.)
.claude/
.kiro/*
!.kiro/specs/
.agents/
/sdlc.config.json
/pipelines.json
memory/*/_index.md
/context/
